== arm a stable condition and action ==
armed: when-deploy-ready
starts on the watcher's next cycle; or run: bin/fm-procevent.sh reconcile
reminder: deterministic, safe, reversible actions only; judgment and destructive actions stay on the wake-and-decide path
== reconcile executes the condition source ==
reconciled: published=0 started=1 stopped=0 uncertain=0
== durable fired outcome ==
  when: when-deploy-ready
  status: fired
  detail: the condition held and the action exited 0
  condition_polls: 1
  action_exit: 0
  output:
  deployed
